  "description": "Small flat roof extension to the side of the building . Improve the thermal & sound proofing efficiency of the extended part of the building, Inside the extension add additional toilets facilities including disabled toilet and improve customer flow. \n\nEntrance porch - Re organise the customer entrance into the building so that it protects residents on the other side of the dual carriageway from the potential of customer generated noise as they enter or leave  the building. \nNote - The original entrance is designated as a fire exist to mitigate any noise issues on dual carriage way side of the building.  ",
